import Init

/-! Canonical lexicographic rows of iterated tetrahedral faces. A face has four
base-150 digits, with vertex `v` stored as `v + 1` and trailing zero padding.
The depth-three rows pair each face with the witness from
`tetrahedron-collar-16.json`. The remainder modulo 64 is the witness tag.
Tags 0–16 and 17–33 give the height of main colors 0 and 1 respectively.
Tags 34 and 35 mark the pockets of colors 0 and 1. -/

